{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.22]Fire, I'm on fire (Ah)\n[00:13.10]Candle and l-lean\n[Chorus]\n[00:16.40]Fire, I'm on fire\n[00:17.62]I'm getting higher, higher, higher\n[00:20.66]Hell on Earth coming down to the wire\n[00:23.70]Inspire, until I perspire\n[00:26.58]Higher, higher, higher (Let's go)\n[00:28.32]I'm on fire, fire, fire (Let's go)\n[00:34.18]Hell on Earth comes down to the wire (Doomslayer)\n[00:38.34]Inspire, until I perspire\n[Verse 1]\n[00:40.26]These niggas my sons (These niggas my sons, what else?)\n[00:42.40]Well, fuck them kids (Let's go)\n[00:43.62]My dad taught me that one (Oh no), so how can I forget? (Oh yeah)\n[00:46.18]Hard work gotta pay off (It does), if you wanna live like this (Uh-huh)\n[00:50.30]I don't really got no cough (Uh-uh), but there's codeine in my piss (Codeine in my piss)\n[00:55.28]Slime hit me like, \"I'm rich\" (Slime hit me like, \"I'm rich\")\n[00:57.00]He say I gotta start acting like I'm rich (Uh)\n[01:00.28]I'm flying through the skies in the car like Rick (Uh)\n[01:01.76]Play your bitch like Guitar, I hit her like a riff (Uh)\n[01:03.66]Got the Raf Simons like the first name riff (Uh)\n[01:05.28]You catch these hands if you don't catch my drift (Let's go)\n[01:07.56]Surf in that bitch it's a wave around here, if you got a problem then my fault (Yeah)\n[01:10.28]All I know is get money, get money, get money (Yeah)\n[01:12.20]If it ain't 'bout that, then just leave me alone (Yeah)\n[01:13.76]I roll up a backwood, I don't smoke out a bowl (Yeah)\n[01:15.50]Gotta slow down on pills, I've been losing control (Yeah)\n[01:17.12]Take a Percocet 30 and then I take some more (Yeah)\n[01:18.76]Plus I love promethazine you know I'ma pour (L-L-Lean)\n[Chorus]\n[01:22.34]Fire, I'm on fire\n[01:24.36]I'm getting higher, higher, higher (Bih)\n[01:28.52]Hell on earth coming down to the wire (Bih, bih)\n[01:31.40]Inspire until I perspire (Bih, bih-bih)\n[01:34.08]Higher, higher, higher (Bih, bih)\n[01:37.00]I'm on fire, fire, fire (Bih, bih)\n[01:41.80]Hell on earth comes down to the wire (Doomslayer)\n[01:46.24]Inspire, until I perspire (Bih, bih)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:48.18]I told you I'm these niggas dad (I am), and it's making them mad (Uh)\n[01:51.74]I run a whole country, shit getting funny ain't American Dad\n[01:54.38]You run up on me, then that choppa is munchin' (Grrah)\n[01:56.28]It's getting hungry, I'm a gun junkie\n[01:57.90]Where I come from this shit look like Jumanji (Uh-huh)\n[01:59.32]Come to Chicago bitch better wrap up, no mummy\n[02:01.30]All these bands, I can fuck your mommy (Uh)\n[02:02.90]She ain't as pretty as your lil' auntie, ayy\n[02:05.04]Guns help me get my family safe\n[02:06.24]Stay the fuck outta my business, the fuck outta my way\n[02:08.24]These lil' niggas try to fuck up the wave\n[02:10.10]Me? I'm just tryna fuck up a safe\n[02:11.80]Some of the millions I have, I save\n[02:13.28]But remember that you cannot take it to your grave\n[02:15.68]Who, me? Nigga, you want some beef with me?\n[02:18.14]You must be a dummy (Dummy)\n[02:19.46]Bitch, I'm wit' NLMB, that's a team (The gang)\n[02:21.52]Bitch, I'm wit' NLMB, that's the gang (That's gang)\n[02:23.22]Bitch, I'm wit' NLMB, we some kings (That's gang, that's gang)\n[02:26.16]Doing my thing, always come through with the heat, like\n[Chorus]\n[02:29.94]Fire, I'm on fire (Oh)\n[02:32.36]I'm getting higher, higher, higher (Fire)\n[02:35.88]Hell on earth coming down to the wire\n[02:38.94]Inspire, until I perspire (Let's go-let's go-let's go)\n[02:51.90]Higher, higher, higher (Let's go-let's go)\n[03:00.04]I'm on fire, fire, fire (Let's go-let's go-let's go)\n[03:05.08]Hell on earth comes down to the wire (Let's go)\n[03:07.70]Inspire, until I perspire (Oh)","words":[[1.22,2.14,"Fire,"],[2.26,2.3,"I'm"],[2.4,2.72,"on"],[11.34,11.44,"fire"],[11.68,12.98,"(Ah)"],[13.1,13.3,"Candle"],[13.58,13.86,"and"],[15.6,16.22,"l-lean"],[16.4,16.82,"Fire,"],[16.94,17.06,"I'm"],[17.12,17.2,"on"],[17.28,17.54,"fire"],[17.62,17.68,"I'm"]